>Safe-to-spend number</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Fast, simple daily check-ins</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="copilot.money" data-vendor-name="Copilot" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  Copilot  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>$95/yr</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Yes</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Auto-categorized</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Apple users who want great design</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="everydollar.com" data-vendor-name="EveryDollar" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  <a href="https://everydollar.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>EveryDollar</a>  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Free / $79.99/yr</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Plus tier only</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Zero-based (Ramsey)</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Dave Ramsey's debt payoff method</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="goodbudget.com" data-vendor-name="Goodbudget" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  <a href="https://goodbudget.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Goodbudget</a>  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Free / $80/yr</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Envelope</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Manual budgeting, no bank linking</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="albert.com" data-vendor-name="Albert" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  Albert  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>$19.99 to $39.99/mo; 30-day trial</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Not published</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Custom budget; AI assistant builds one automatically</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Budgeting alongside saving, investing, and ID protection</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="bountisphere.com" data-vendor-name="Bountisphere" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  Bountisphere  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>$7/mo or $70/yr; 7-day free trial</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Not stated; page describes nightly bank sync</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Calendar forecast of income, bills, balances up to 24 months</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Seeing upcoming bills and lowest balances ahead</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="floosyo.com" data-vendor-name="FloosYo" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  FloosYo  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>$9.99/mo or $99.99/yr; 7-day free trial</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No (bank linking optional)</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Category spending envelopes</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Tracking spending and subscriptions, with voice entry</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="budgetvault.app" data-vendor-name="BudgetVault" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  BudgetVault  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Free</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No (manual entry only)</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Category-based monthly limits</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Privacy and low cost; works offline</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="envelopebudgeting.com" data-vendor-name="Envelope" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  Envelope  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>$10/month or $40/yr; annual fee waived at $5,000 card spend</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No (budget runs on its own checking account)</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Envelope budgeting with virtual cards and sinking funds</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Budgeters wanting budget, checking account and debit cards in one app</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="netoapp.es" data-vendor-name="Neto" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  Neto  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Free; optional PRO from €49.99/yr (iPhone, Spain pricing)</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No (manual entry, no bank connection)</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Manual tracking with category budget limits and savings goals</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>People who track spending and net worth without linking banks</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="luckyfriday.app" data-vendor-name="Lucky Friday" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  Lucky Friday  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Free; paid $12.99/mo per user</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No; Free plan has no account linking</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Flexible category budgets</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Custom categories and biweekly or irregular income</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="hearthbudget.com" data-vendor-name="Hearth" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  Hearth  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Free; Premium $4.99/mo or $34.99/yr</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No; manual entry, bank sync is Premium</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Envelope</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Couples sharing one budget</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="smartwalt.com" data-vendor-name="SmartWalt" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  SmartWalt  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Free; Pro $4.99/mo or $49/yr</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No (no bank login; manual, voice or receipt scan)</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Category budgets and safe-to-spend; no named method</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>People who want to skip bank links and log spending themselves</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="middleclassfinance.app" data-vendor-name="Middle Class Finance" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  Middle Class Finance  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Free web app ($0/month)</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No (manual entry or CSV/OFX/QFX/QBO import)</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Zero-based, 50/30/20, envelope or simple</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Paycheck households that prefer not to link a bank</td> </tr><tr data-vendor-domain="pocketsmith.com" data-vendor-name="PocketSmith" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l> <th scope="row" data-no-entity-link="" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>  <a href="https://www.pocketsmith.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="astro-nx7ly24l" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>PocketSmith</a>  </th> <td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Free plan; paid from $9.99/mo billed annually</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>No; free plan allows manual imports</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Calendar-based budgets with optional rollover</td><td data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>Cash-flow forecasting and multi-currency budgets; projection length varies by plan</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <p class="vt-note" data-astro-cid-nx7ly24l>
